---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const pageTitle = "About // Manifesto";
const pageDescription = "Manifesto of DissidentX: A witness in the ruins, reclaiming contemplative thought against conformity.";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto my-6 sm:my-10">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] pb-6 mb-8">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        The Desert & The Ruins
      </h1>
      <p class="font-serif font-light italic text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] mt-2">
        A witness against the consensus of illusion
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Manifesto Prose -->
    <div class="prose text-[var(--color-ink)]">
      <p>
        DissidentX exists as a space for honest inquiry, spiritual resistance, and quiet reflection — a sanctuary for those who value truth beyond convenience or social conformity. In an age intoxicated by noise, consumerism, and fleeting distractions, this project is an invitation to withdraw into the interior desert: to think critically, question prevailing narratives, and anchor oneself in the enduring truths that have withstood the collapse of empires.
      </p>

      <blockquote class="border-l border-[var(--color-crimson)] pl-5 py-1 my-8 font-serif italic text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--color-ink-muted)]">
        "Orthodoxy is the last true rebellion because it demands the death of the ego, the rejection of worldly vanity, and the courage to stand alone before the Living God."
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        It is born from a personal commitment to disciplined self-study in theology, classical philosophy, and patristic wisdom. The challenges of our time demand more than intellectual critique; they demand ascetic vigilance, character, and inner stillness. Here, I document an ongoing struggle of learning, unlearning, and seeking reality amidst the ruins.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Subscribe Section -->
    <section id="subscribe" class="mt-14 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)]">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">
        Subscribe
      </h2>
      <p class="font-serif text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] mb-6">
        Receive essays directly when published. Infrequent dispatches on philosophy, theology, and contemplation.
      </p>

      <form
        action="mailto:real.dissidentx@gmail.com?subject=Subscribe%20to%20DissidentX%20Dispatches"
        method="POST"
        enctype="text/plain"
        class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-md"
      >
        <label for="subscribe-email" class="sr-only">Email address</label>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="subscribe-email"
          name="email"
          placeholder="your.email@domain.com"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          class="flex-1 bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-rule-light)] px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-white placeholder-[var(--color-ink-faint)] focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--color-crimson)] min-h-[44px]"
        />
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-white bg-[var(--color-crimson)] hover:bg-[#a00d24] px-5 py-2.5 uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors cursor-pointer min-h-[44px] inline-flex items-center justify-center"
        >
          Subscribe
        </button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
